      "id": "claim_c6a2ec8c7d524c30bf41d7c5f152b572",
      "statement": "The highlighter runs Shiki on createJavaScriptRegexEngine from @shikijs/engine-javascript because Shiki's default Oniguruma engine requires WebAssembly.instantiate, which is disallowed in Cloudflare Workers (workerd); shiki and the engine are peer dependencies (^4.0.0) so the host site controls their versions.",
