    {
      "id": "claim_2fa1342839334904abf3ad379a5a9d60",
      "statement": "highlightCode walks a fallback ladder: an unloaded non-text language is loaded on demand and silently degrades to text if unavailable; an unloaded theme resolves through THEME_MAP (a static record of dynamic import thunks whose keys match the 24 THEMES values so Vite can bundle each theme as a chunk), falling back to loadTheme by name, and on failure logs an error and uses github-dark; final rendering calls codeToHtml with text and github-dark as last-resort defaults.",
      "evidence": [
